WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.770
- GENTLEMEN, IT HAS BEEN
A PLEASURE

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.472
AND AN HONOR TO MEET YOU
AND YOUR--YOUR PEOPLE.

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:10.810
THE U.S. GOVERNMENT SUPPORTS YOU
IN EVERY POSSIBLE WAY.

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:13.446
IDEOLOGICALLY, OF COURSE.

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.416
HOWEVER, WE CANNOT OFFER
ANY MILITARY AID AT THIS TIME.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.384
- WITH ALL DUE RESPECT,
AMBASSADOR,

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:20.186
WE NEED MORE THAN THAT.

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:22.388
- WE ARE DEALING WITH TERRORISM
ON A DAILY BASIS.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.724
- OH, THAT'S SO UNFORTUNATE.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.726
- WARLORDS OVERRUN VILLAGES.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.327
- YES, THAT'S REGRETTABLE.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:32.131
- RAPES, TORTURES,
ALL MANNER OF HUMAN ATROCITY.

00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:34.400
- THAT'S REALLY SAD,
BUT THE U.S. MILITARY

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.202
IS SIMPLY SPREAD TOO THIN.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:40.139
WE CAN'T AFFORD ANOTHER
INTERVENTION AT THIS TIME.

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:42.742
- BUT WHAT WE COULD USE
YOUR HELP WITH REALLY

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:45.211
IS PROTECTING
OUR VULNERABLE, PLENTIFUL,

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:48.081
AND NEWLY-DISCOVERED
OIL RESERVES.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.484
- OIL?
EXCUSE ME ONE SECOND.

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.720
OPERATION GOLDEN EAGLE IS A GO.

00:00:59.758 --> 00:01:01.694
WELCOME TO DEMOCRACY.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.236
- UH, WE ALSO HAVE
NATURAL GASSES!

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:12.135
- OH, YES, A LOT.
LOTS OF IT.

